= Klaus Barthel

Klaus Barthel from Bavaria sat in the Bundestag for over twenty-five years and led the AfA, the party's workers' association. Nobody in the party has fought longer against the Hartz reforms.

- @labor_rights_
- @union_unity
- @depression
- @root: Return to main

@labor_rights_
title: Workers' rights
subtitle: Use the labour ministry.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" or spd_in_government = 0 : The SPD does not hold the labour ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labor_rights

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Bring the unions and the party closer together.
